            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "This dashboard reads from **AWS CloudWatch** (namespace `app`), written to by the `cloudwatch` collector (`Beberlei\\Metrics\\Collector\\CloudWatch`), through the official `aws/aws-sdk-php` client and its `PutMetricData` API. It points at **LocalStack** (see `infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.yml`), which emulates the CloudWatch API locally, not real AWS. Every metric is published as one data point per metric name (e.g. `homepage.visits`). `measure()`/`increment()`/`decrement()` use the `Count` unit, `timing()` uses `Milliseconds`. The `$metric` variable above is populated with the CloudWatch `metrics()` template function, so it lists every metric name ever published to the `app` namespace, including custom ones from the form."
            }
        },
